  "bodyHash": "rcrEdmxWKq4=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用爱制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于本模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">“篝火驱敌”是一个可配置的模组，可在篝火周围的可配置半径内阻止敌对生物生成。该模组还会阻止归类为<strong>“EntityClassification/MobCategory.Monster”</strong>的模组实体生成。当放置篝火时，如果周围有敌对生物，模组会将其灼烧30秒，直至它们死亡或篝火被破坏。<br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:16px\">1.16版本中的<span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:16px\">灵魂篝火</span>也兼容！此功能可配置。</span></strong></span><br>你可能也对<span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/healing-campfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">治愈篝火</a></strong></span>感兴趣。<br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>某些实体可能未被归类为“怪物”，但仍可能对玩家有敌意。模组内有一个包含这些特定实体的自定义列表。如果你发现此类实体，请通过问题追踪器告知我，以便将其添加到列表中。</em></span><br><strong>当前列表中的内容：</strong>来自 Quark 的猎犬（FoxHound）。</p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience 整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 组合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventHostilesRadius</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 48，最小值 1，最大值 128</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">篝火周围以方块计量的半径，在此范围内敌对生物生成将被阻止。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>burnHostilesAroundWhenPlaced&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，当玩家放置篝火时，会灼烧半径范围内的所有敌对生物。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>burnHostilesRadiusModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.5，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">默认为 0.5。这意味着如果半径为 16，篝火会在半径为 8 的范围内灼烧原有的生物。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventMobSpawnerSpawns</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，当篝火在半径范围内时，刷怪笼的生成也会被禁用。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeLit</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，仅当篝火方块被点燃时才生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>campfireMustBeSignalling</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，仅当篝火方块发出信号时才生效。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>1.16+ 版本专属配置选项：</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForNormalCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，模组将对普通篝火生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableEffectForSoulCampfires</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，模组将对灵魂篝火生效。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以自由地在任何整合包中使用本模组，只要下载链接仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已禁用，因为我无法在众多独立的模组页面中跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
